WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.310
<v Grandma>Maknae, could you bring me the pill case from the desk?

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:09.599
<v Maknae>Of course, Grandma. I'll get it from the desk.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.794
<v Maknae>I found the pill case!

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.530
<v Maknae>Grandma, I've got your pill case.

00:00:50.433 --> 00:00:52.795
<v Grandma>Okay, hand it to me.

00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:54.421
<v Maknae>Here you go!

00:00:54.267 --> 00:00:58.477
<v Grandma>Oh, what a good little helper.
